comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-07T13:34:48.714Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete all-status corpus of 2653 items plus open and in-progress searches contains no GH-1214 owner. Existing completed recovery and aggregation work retains historical release attribution. Report https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1214; delivery PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1217."
  "2026-09-07T13:40:16.269Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: descriptor-pressure regression returned only 48 of 128 items before the fix. Bounded 32-file batches pass complete reads and still report a genuinely denied file. All 26 focused platform tests pass including the unchanged 10000-item aggregate and exact-byte aborted rebase proof with repository-local LF policy."
  "2026-09-07T13:47:45.306Z","harness:codex","Verification update: linked focused suites passed for all three report owners. Typecheck, ESLint and docs links passed. A freshly packed candidate installed independently with npm and Bun passed SDK exports and the complete history redaction/restore/compaction/verification journey; both installed CLIs retained Error: Unknown option --label with oversized input within the 768-token text ceiling. Full literal coverage and the complete static chain are still running; hosted platform proof is not yet available."
  "2026-09-07T13:55:18.475Z","harness:codex","All 8541 tests across 639 files passed with literal 100/100/100/100 coverage and zero uncovered counts. The complete pnpm quality:static command, typecheck, ESLint, docs links and tracked-file secret scan passed. Linked tests and fresh installed npm/Bun candidate history plus diagnostic journeys passed. Full tracker validation is ok with zero history drift; 295 pre-existing historical resolution warnings are unchanged. Hosted exact-head CI, platform matrix and renewed bot review remain mandatory before merge; this evidence makes no publication claim."
  "2026-09-07T13:58:45.067Z","harness:codex","Integrity clarification: the first broad validation overlapped live updates and reported transient hash drift for pm-m4uyyj and pm-zk67yf; its earlier zero-drift summary was premature. The settled validation after closure checked all 2656 items and reports zero drift, missing/unreadable streams, hash/chain mismatches, version skew or workspace mismatch. All 2372 closed items were checked and the 295 historical resolution warnings remain unchanged. Package-generated changelog and check passed using latest pm-changelog 2026.9.6."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-07T13:48:21.098Z","harness:codex","Complete reads require bounded scheduling as well as fail-closed completeness receipts: an unbounded scan can manufacture unreadable files by exhausting descriptors. Pair deterministic resource-pressure tests with the unchanged real 10000-item platform fixture. Exact-byte Git tests must explicitly fix repository newline policy."
